## How work arrives

- Specs live in Notion (Specs database). Work is cut into Linear issues in team <TEAM KEY>, one slice each.
- Each Linear issue syncs to a GitHub issue. The label `claude` means Claude should build it.
- Read the issue's acceptance criteria and the linked spec before writing code. If the spec link is missing or the criteria are unclear, comment on the issue with the question and stop.

